      "correspondence": "The first deletions remove group entries from Kη_j, the last deletions remove vertices of the affine simplex; the shared face cancels. The explicit substitution starts at W₀ and ends with W_m, leaving a single invariant coboundary. Pairing with a cycle kills this term by the chain–cochain identity. The sWhit_of binder _hEv does not occur in its proof body; that body uses pEv directly. The independent degree-one model has Kc(b)=b−A(t), η₁=−dA and s₁=−1, so ω=dA and its period on [2] is 2.",
